# Key: <level>/<column>.<n>; fields: verbs (the issuer's own, as given), about, para, prac, ben. Force describes; addressee learner.
NAME = {'entry-1': 'Entry 1', 'entry-2': 'Entry 2', 'entry-3': 'Entry 3'} | {'l%d' % i: 'Level %d' % i for i in range(1, 9)}
